data: {"id": "70298da6640c48f8-thinking-parallel_evidence-2119", "run_id": "70298da6640c48f8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口说明\n\n实体身份确认\n- Pod: workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c, namespace: aiops-case-06, Node: node2/10.2.0.50\n- PodIP: 172.16.104.17/32\n- Container: app\n- 当前状态：status: Running，但存在持续 CrashLoopBackOff 的 BackOff 事件（x474 over 106m，最近 100s 仍有记录）\n\n支持 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 候选的事实\n- kubectl_describe 显示 Reason: CrashLoopBackOff，并且 Warning BackOff 事件持续发生（\"Back-off restarting failed container app\"），说明容器经历反复崩溃与重启循环。\n- 事件时间跨度达 106 分钟，最近仍有触发，表明异常不是瞬时恢复，而是持续性重启失败。\n- Pod 的 UID 为 20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd，身", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788442905074, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

